# Keep the original names of the app's own classes and members so that the stack traces and log tags
# in crash reports sent by mail are readable without a mapping file. Library code is still obfuscated,
# which Google Play requires (minimum obfuscation percentage for apps with large DEX code).
# Shrinking and optimization (inlining, class merging, ...) stay allowed for the app's code.
-keepnames,allowoptimization class com.nextcloud.talk.** { *; }
